    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Backtracking</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Bitmask</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/subsets/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 78</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Subsets</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Each element is a yes/no choice, so there are exactly 2<sup>n</sup> subsets. Record the current set at every recursion node and only let later elements join: each subset is built once, in Θ(n·2<sup>n</sup>) time, which matches the size of the output.</p>\n"
